# The values the Deploy to Cloudflare button asks for. For local development, copy this file to
# .dev.vars (never committed) and fill it in.
#
# Your email address: only this address can sign in the first time. Several, comma-separated: the
# first of them to sign in becomes the owner.
INBOX_OWNER_EMAIL=
# Locks stored secrets and signs receipts. Paste the output of `openssl rand -base64 32` and keep a
# copy somewhere safe. Several, comma-separated and newest first, rotate a key without downtime.
# Empty, the inbox runs but stores no secret and issues no receipt.
INBOX_SECRET_KEY=
# The address the inbox emails from, like inbox@yourdomain.com. Its domain must be onboarded to
# Cloudflare Email Sending on the same account (Workers Paid). Empty, or not onboarded yet: your
# sign-in link is written to the Worker's logs instead.
MAIL_FROM=
